		"details": {
			"isComplex": true,
			"level": {
				"value": 7
			},
			"disable": "<p>The haunt can be disabled in one of three ways:</p><ul><li><p>Four @Check[religion|dc:21] (trained) checks to banish the spectral image of Belcorra.</p></li><li><p>Two @Check[deception|dc:26] (trained) checks to goad this shard, which is infused with a minute portion of Belcorra's essence, into a fury, shattering its focus.</p></li><li><p>One @Check[athletics|dc:31] (expert) check to smash the mirror's magical structure, permanently shattering it.</p></li></ul>",
			"description": "<p>The reflection in the mirror subtly twists and distorts, its expression taking on an unnerving sneer of malice. It is the image of a beautiful but cruel-looking woman with blood-flecked lips and hands that look closer to claws.</p>",
			"reset": "<p>The haunt re-forms after 1 minute unless it has been disabled.</p>",
			"routine": "<p>(2 actions)</p><p>The haunt uses the Become The Experiment action.</p>",
			"publication": {
				"title": "Pathfinder GM Core",
				"authors": "weepingminotaur",
				"license": "ORC",
				"remaster": true
			}
