		{
			"img": "https://assets.forge-vtt.com/bazaar/systems/pf2e/assets/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
			"name": "Become The Experiment",
			"sort": 100000,
			"system": {
				"description": {
					"gm": "",
					"value": "<p><strong>Effect</strong> The image of the Ghost Queen, Belcorra, whispers in your mind, compelling you to submit to the experiments of her servants. The haunt deals @Damage[(2d10+9)[mental]] damage to a single non-unholy creature in the room. The creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:23|traits:damaging-effect] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage, becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1}, and gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition for 1 round, driven to take one of the ladders down the east hatch.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage. It also becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} and gains the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.sDPxOjQ9kx2RZE8D]{Fleeing} condition for 1 minute, driven to take one of the ladders down the east hatch.</p>"
				},
